{"id":"career-01","text":"我想辞职转行，但担心失败，不知道该不该走","primary_intent":"career","emotion":"anxious","recommended_move":"clarify"}
{"id":"career-02","text":"老板给我升职了，可我觉得自己根本胜任不了","primary_intent":"career","emotion":"anxious","recommended_move":"reframe"}
{"id":"career-03","text":"这份工作钱多但没有意义，另一份喜欢但收入低","primary_intent":"career","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"clarify"}
{"id":"decision-01","text":"两个选择都要付出代价，我一直下不了决心","primary_intent":"decision","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"clarify"}
