{"id":"emotion-01","text":"我最近总觉得很孤独，好像没有人真正理解我","primary_intent":"emotional_support","emotion":"lonely","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"emotion-02","text":"项目失败以后我很难过，不想听大道理","primary_intent":"emotional_support","emotion":"sad","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"emotion-03","text":"我被同事背后抢功，真的气死了","primary_intent":"emotional_support","emotion":"angry","recommended_move":"reflect"}
