{"id":"relationship-03","text":"朋友总把负面情绪倒给我，我该设置边界吗","primary_intent":"relationship","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"action"}
{"id":"learning-01","text":"我读了很多哲学书，却越来越不知道自己相信什么","primary_intent":"learning","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"reframe"}
{"id":"learning-02","text":"考试快到了，我一翻书就紧张","primary_intent":"learning","emotion":"anxious","recommended_move":"action"}
{"id":"learning-03","text":"请用一个生活里的例子解释什么是斯多葛主义","primary_intent":"learning","emotion":"neutral","recommended_move":"example"}
{"id":"self-01","text":"我总想证明自己，是不是因为内心不够自信","primary_intent":"self_understanding","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"self-02","text":"为什么我每次得到想要的东西以后还是空虚","primary_intent":"self_understanding","emotion":"sad","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"casual-01","text":"今天阳光很好，忽然想和你随便聊聊","primary_intent":"casual","emotion":"hopeful","recommended_move":"clarify"}
