{"id":"end-02","text":"我不想继续这个话题了，我们结束吧","primary_intent":"end","emotion":"neutral","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"implicit-01","text":"随便吧，反正怎么做都没有用","primary_intent":"emotional_support","emotion":"sad","recommended_move":"reflect"}
{"id":"implicit-02","text":"我问的不是怎么成功，而是值不值得继续","primary_intent":"decision","emotion":"confused","recommended_move":"reframe"}
